"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":14,"created_at":"2025-05-12T18:04:45Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T07:18:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproduced in 4.4 stable\n- Reproduced on master\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 11 - Vulkan (Forward+)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI've been writing a compositor effect recently, and I needed to get information about the projection of the camera. To do so, I'm using render_data.get_render_scene_data().get_cam_projection(). When calling get_z_near and get_aspect, this projection returns the correct values, but negative instead of positive. This caused quite a lot of trouble when trying to debug my effect.\n\nI don't know whether this is intentional or not, but either way it should probably be documented.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new CompositorEffect\n- In render_callback, get camera projection using render_data.get_render_scene_data().get_cam_projection()\n- Print out both projection.get_z_near() and projection.get_aspect(), and see that they're negative values\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[projection_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20230840/projection_test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106312/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106312/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}